            },
            {
              "review_id": "places/ChIJu6qq6Y0Z2jERZQZRLwnba5k/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aSWMwVkNTV2x6UXpNMGFVcE1VbVY1Ym10UVNtYxAB",
              "text": "A huge, modern, expensive shrine to consumerism. If you have the money, and yoy need lots,  you can find anything here. We did however have the best lunch date at Twinings much to my surprise and delight. I would absolutely go there again.",
